{"vid":"w0fvnY1JJWA","source":"w0fvnY1JJWA.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":3.1,"txt":"Every 53 minutes, a worker in this"},{"t":5.8,"txt":"country is seriously injured because a"},{"t":8.6,"txt":"machine or an electrical system was not"},{"t":11.1,"txt":"properly de-energized before someone put"},{"t":14,"txt":"their hands on it."},{"t":15.6,"txt":"And in most of those cases, the worker"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"thought it was safe."},{"t":20,"txt":"Today, we are talking about the six"},{"t":22.1,"txt":"steps of the lockout tagout procedure,"},{"t":25.2,"txt":"specifically for electrical work."},{"t":27.9,"txt":"Knowing the steps and actually doing the"},{"t":30.3,"txt":"steps are two very different things out"},{"t":32.8,"txt":"there on the job."},{"t":34.4,"txt":"Step one is notify."},{"t":37.2,"txt":"Before you touch anything, before you"},{"t":39,"txt":"pull a single breaker, you tell the"},{"t":40.9,"txt":"people around you what you are about to"},{"t":42.6,"txt":"do."},{"t":43.8,"txt":"You let affected employees know the"},{"t":45.4,"txt":"equipment is going down."},{"t":47.4,"txt":"Think about it. How many times have you"},{"t":49.4,"txt":"been on a job site and somebody just"},{"t":51.3,"txt":"killed the power without saying a word?"},{"t":53.9,"txt":"Production stops, people scramble, and"},{"t":56.6,"txt":"for a split second, nobody knows what is"},{"t":58.5,"txt":"happening."},{"t":59.7,"txt":"That moment of confusion is dangerous. A"},{"t":62.2,"txt":"quick heads-up takes 10 seconds."},{"t":64.7,"txt":"Step two is shut down."},{"t":67,"txt":"You use the normal shutdown procedure"},{"t":68.7,"txt":"for that piece of equipment. You do not"},{"t":71,"txt":"improvise. You follow the written"},{"t":73.1,"txt":"procedure."},{"t":74.4,"txt":"Every machine, every panel, every"},{"t":77.1,"txt":"disconnect has a right way to be shut"},{"t":79.5,"txt":"down."},{"t":80.6,"txt":"If you do not know what that procedure"},{"t":82.4,"txt":"is for the equipment you are working on"},{"t":84.1,"txt":"today, that is the conversation to have"},{"t":86.6,"txt":"with your foreman right now, before the"},{"t":88.8,"txt":"work starts, not after."},{"t":91.1,"txt":"Step three is isolate."},{"t":93.5,"txt":"You locate every single energy source"},{"t":95.6,"txt":"feeding that equipment, and you"},{"t":97.2,"txt":"physically isolate each one."},{"t":99.5,"txt":"Electrical work makes this tricky"},{"t":101.5,"txt":"because you might have one obvious"},{"t":103,"txt":"breaker and three others you did not"},{"t":105.3,"txt":"know about."},{"t":106.6,"txt":"We have seen it happen."},{"t":108.3,"txt":"A maintenance tech isolates the main"},{"t":110.1,"txt":"feed, starts working inside the panel,"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"and then finds out a second circuit from"},{"t":114.7,"txt":"a different source is still live. That"},{"t":117.3,"txt":"is how people get hurt."},{"t":119.2,"txt":"Know all your energy sources before you"},{"t":121.2,"txt":"touch anything."},{"t":122.7,"txt":"Step four is lockout and tagout."},{"t":125.8,"txt":"You apply your lock and your tag to the"},{"t":127.7,"txt":"energy isolating device,"},{"t":129.7,"txt":"the breaker, the disconnect, the switch,"},{"t":132.6,"txt":"whatever it is, your lock, not your"},{"t":135,"txt":"buddy's lock."},{"t":136.5,"txt":"The tag tells everyone who put it there"},{"t":138.2,"txt":"and why."},{"t":139.4,"txt":"And here is something worth saying"},{"t":140.8,"txt":"plainly."},{"t":142,"txt":"A tag without a lock is a warning, not a"},{"t":144.9,"txt":"barrier."},{"t":146,"txt":"Wherever a lock is physically possible,"},{"t":148.3,"txt":"use one."},{"t":149.6,"txt":"Step five is release stored energy."},{"t":152.5,"txt":"This is the step people skip or rush,"},{"t":154.8,"txt":"and it is one of the most dangerous"},{"t":156.4,"txt":"mistakes you can make in electrical"},{"t":157.9,"txt":"work."},{"t":159,"txt":"Capacitors hold a charge. Large drives"},{"t":161.6,"txt":"hold voltage long after you shut the"},{"t":163.3,"txt":"system down."},{"t":164.8,"txt":"Always release the stored energy. In"},{"t":166.7,"txt":"other words, bleed the capacitors."},{"t":169.3,"txt":"Step six is verify."},{"t":171.6,"txt":"Test before you touch. Use your meter."},{"t":174.4,"txt":"Confirm a zero energy state at the point"},{"t":176.4,"txt":"of work, not at the panel."},{"t":179,"txt":"This step is your last line of defense."},{"t":181.5,"txt":"Every other step could be done perfectly"},{"t":183.5,"txt":"and still verification catches"},{"t":185.9,"txt":"something. It is 30 seconds that can"},{"t":188.1,"txt":"save your life."},{"t":189.7,"txt":"Six steps."},{"t":191.3,"txt":"Notify, shut down, isolate, lock and"},{"t":195.2,"txt":"tag, release stored energy, verify."},{"t":199.3,"txt":"This is not paperwork."},{"t":201.1,"txt":"This is the difference between going"},{"t":202.7,"txt":"home tonight and not."},{"t":204.6,"txt":"Every one of those steps exists because"},{"t":206.8,"txt":"somebody somewhere paid a price to teach"},{"t":209.3,"txt":"us it mattered."},{"t":210.7,"txt":"Make sure you know the LOTO procedure"},{"t":212.8,"txt":"for every piece of equipment you are"},{"t":214.4,"txt":"going to touch."},{"t":216,"txt":"If you are unclear, say something. That"},{"t":218.6,"txt":"is what your crew is here for. So,"},{"t":220.4,"txt":"please stay safe on the job."},{"t":223,"txt":"Did you know that in 2020, a study"},{"t":225.5,"txt":"conducted by the Associated Builders and"},{"t":227.9,"txt":"Contractors found that daily safety"},{"t":230.3,"txt":"toolbox talks lead to a remarkable 82%"},{"t":234,"txt":"reduction in total recordable incident"},{"t":236.8,"txt":"rates compared to those conducted"},{"t":238.6,"txt":"monthly. The study shows that the"},{"t":240.5,"txt":"frequency of toolbox talks directly"},{"t":243.1,"txt":"correlates with incident rates."},{"t":244.9,"txt":"Consistent safety toolbox talks lead to"},{"t":247.9,"txt":"less accidents, which is why many"},{"t":249.9,"txt":"companies this year are using Safely EO"},{"t":252.9,"txt":"to create and schedule these talks"},{"t":254.8,"txt":"weeks and months in advance. So"},{"t":257.8,"txt":"your team will be consistently reminded"},{"t":260.2,"txt":"of the job hazards and safety protocols."},{"t":262.7,"txt":"You get access to Safely EO's toolbox"},{"t":265.3,"txt":"talk library that comes with"},{"t":267.2,"txt":"hundreds of text-based and video-based"},{"t":269.8,"txt":"toolbox talks that covers any"},{"t":271.7,"txt":"industry. The toolbox talk app makes it"},{"t":274.6,"txt":"easy for your employees and supervisors"},{"t":277.4,"txt":"to consume safety talks from their own"},{"t":279.7,"txt":"mobile devices"},{"t":281,"txt":">>"},{"t":281.1,"txt":">> and acknowledge its completion at the"},{"t":283.1,"txt":"click of a button. All completed safety"},{"t":285.4,"txt":"talks are tracked and the data"},{"t":287.3,"txt":"can be exported and available for use."},{"t":289.7,"txt":"The platform digitizes your safety talks"},{"t":291.9,"txt":"process so you can focus on what really"},{"t":294.4,"txt":"matters, keeping your team safe and"},{"t":296.8,"txt":"informed. Don't wait until it's too"},{"t":298.8,"txt":"late. Workplace incidents can cost your"},{"t":301.2,"txt":"company millions in liability,"},{"t":303.3,"txt":">>"},{"t":303.3,"txt":">> lost productivity, and damaged"},{"t":305.2,"txt":"reputation. To learn more, just click"},{"t":307.8,"txt":"the link in the description of this"},{"t":309.3,"txt":"video to request a quick demo."}],"words":[{"t":3.12,"w":"Every"},{"t":3.44,"w":"53"},{"t":4.08,"w":"minutes,"},{"t":4.96,"w":"a"},{"t":5.08,"w":"worker"},{"t":5.52,"w":"in"},{"t":5.68,"w":"this"},{"t":5.84,"w":"country"},{"t":6.32,"w":"is"},{"t":6.52,"w":"seriously"},{"t":7.16,"w":"injured"},{"t":8.16,"w":"because"},{"t":8.52,"w":"a"},{"t":8.6,"w":"machine"},{"t":9.36,"w":"or"},{"t":9.52,"w":"an"},{"t":9.6,"w":"electrical"},{"t":10.16,"w":"system"},{"t":10.6,"w":"was"},{"t":10